Error [jet.DuplicateRoute]: Route `/` is registered both by `builder` and `routes_collision/index.jet`
  --> tests/ui/web_app_route_collision.jet:6:39
    |
  6 | fn run() { web.app().route("/", home).routes(from: "routes_collision").csr().serve() }
    |                                       ^^^^^^
 Why: Explicit builder entries and `.routes(from:)` conventions must not claim the same path.
 Fix: Remove one registration, or rename the convention file.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2807

Error [jet.DuplicateRoute]: Earlier registration of route `/`
